1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,260
I'm at the foot of the ladder.

2
00:00:03,260 --> 00:00:12,240
The LEM footpads are only depressed 
in the surface about one or two inches,

3
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:19,770
although the surface appears to be very, 
very fine-grained as you get close to it.

4
00:00:19,770 --> 00:00:22,700
It's almost like a powder.

5
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:25,910
Ground mass is very fine.

6
00:00:36,746 --> 00:00:40,746
Okay, I'm going to step off the LEM now.

7
00:00:47,772 --> 00:00:55,822
That's one small step for [a] man, 
one giant leap for mankind.